@* The Po shell header, on every page signed in or out (MainLayout and BareLayout): the app's name top-left (its logo
   mark before it), top-right the offline and install hints when they apply, the signed-in email (or Sign in), and the
   Settings gear. A plain <header> root, so this file's scoped CSS reaches it. *@
<header class="po-header">
    <a class="po-header__title" href="/">
        <span class="brand-icon-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
            <RadzenIcon Icon="code" class="brand-icon-main" />
            <RadzenIcon Icon="trending_up" class="brand-icon-trend" />
        </span>
        <span>PoRepoLineTracker</span>
    </a>
    <div class="po-header__actions">
        <OfflineIndicator />
        <InstallAppButton />
        <LoginDisplay />
